      "mergedPostDetails": "I've notice that once you have FPV steadycam enabled and change world, you seem to have to disable and enable it again to have post processing other visuals behave as expected. \n\nexample of post processing not beeing applied until re-enableing: https://clips.twitch.tv/ClumsyCuriousMangetoutAliens-OaofB55-W0bvgYF4\n\nand example of the skybox being overlapped with a seemingly delayed render: https://clips.twitch.tv/AltruisticKawaiiShieldTooSpicy-9-rwXxRPXqJ_90iL\n\nThese bugs seem to not be an issue if the FPV steadycam option is toggled off and back on again after changing world so should perhaps be easy to create a work around by having it automatically re-toggle itself after loading the world?",
